    "updated_at": "2016-02-08T08:47:01Z",
    "body": "If you're wondering why we end up pushing a different commit, it's to preserve a linear history (has its downsides, but many upsides), which in turns means that we add a `PR: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/645` line to the commit message so that it's easier to find the context for a commit from just the git log.\n",
